      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The disadvantage of this suggestion would be that the favorites percentage *could* be misinterpreted by some users as a measure of how good a world is. Favorites **can** be an indicator for world quality, but there are many reasons a world might have fewer visits. (Popularity, replayability, etc)\nHowever, I still think this would be a good improvement. We wouldn't be adding any new information, but we'd instead be making the favorites information more useful and accessible.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
