      "value": "@{60329075ba9b3b1a4eb315c4|full_name}: Oh absolutely. That's what I assumed in my suggestion, that it would be a pure front-end improvement.\nBut that gets me thinking... What if it displayed favorites *per user* instead? That might make the stat even more useful. But it would also mean exposing more *actual* information, which the devs might not want.",
