  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please show favorites as a percentage, in addition to the number.\n\n> **Favorites** 7,403 (5.76%)\n\nCurrently, seeing the number of visits a world has isn't... particularly useful. For example, if a world has 600 favorites... is that a high amount? It *completely* depends on the number of visits.\nI think having a percentage, that shows the ratio of favorites to world visits, would **greatly** enhance the usefulness of the favorites stat.",
